</header><main><section class="public-hero"><div><span class="public-eyebrow">JUST &middot; Faculty of Information Technology</span><h1>Your next chapter starts with experience.</h1><p>University Internship Management System brings students, company supervisors, academic supervisors and the Internship Coordinator together through one connected training journey.</p><a class="public-action" href="Auth/Login.aspx">Sign in to UIMS</a><a class="public-action secondary" href="About.aspx">About the system</a></div><figure><img src="Assets/auth/just-campus.jpg" alt="Jordan University of Science and Technology campus library" /><figcaption class="public-credit">Photo: Fawwaz Dawod, 2013 &middot; <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Jordan_University_of_Science_and_Technology%27s_Library.jpg">Source</a> &middot; <a href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/">CC BY-SA 3.0</a></figcaption></figure></section><section class="public-grid" aria-label="Internship journey"><article class="public-card"><h2>Find your placement</h2><p>Explore opportunities, apply and follow company decisions through your student workspace.</p></article><article class="public-card"><h2>Build and reflect</h2><p>Track assigned tasks, submissions, revisions and explicitly approved training hours.</p></article><article class="public-card"><h2>Complete your journey</h2><p>Company and academic evaluations support the Coordinator's separate final completion review.</p></article></section><p class="public-note">Frontend demonstration only. Test identities and records are stored locally in your browser. Firebase and real authentication are postponed. No public registration is available.</p></main><footer class="public-footer">&copy; 2026 Jordan University of Science and Technology &middot; University Internship Management System</footer></form><script src="Js_project/Public/navbar.js" defer="defer"></script></body></html>